Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_7ab34c88-fc6a-35c8-89de-ac57d32c4a04.xml</text>
